# Copy to `.env.test` (gitignored) before running `pnpm --filter @repo/auth test`.
#
# Connection string for the TiDB database the route tests run against. It is
# injected into the test Worker as SERO_POS_DATABASE_URL by vitest.config.ts.
#
# The suite issues DELETEs during teardown, so test/setup.ts refuses to start
# unless the database name matches /test/i. Name the database accordingly —
# e.g. `sero_pos_test`, never `main`.
#
# Same shape as packages/database/.env — see packages/database/.env.example:
#   mysql://<user>.root:<password>@<host>:4000/<database>
#
# Setup, once per clone:
#   1. Create the database on your TiDB cluster: CREATE DATABASE sero_pos_test;
#   2. Point packages/database/.env's DATABASE_URL at it and run
#      `pnpm --filter @repo/database db:migrate` (test runs never perform DDL).
#   3. Copy that same URL here.
TEST_DATABASE_URL=
